James Rising received an email from Anom Dule expressing interest in the PhD program in Environmental Economics at the University of Delaware. Anom highlighted his research background, including studies on methane emissions and the impact of power outages on crime in India. James requested assistance in drafting a professional response. He acknowledged Anom's impressive qualifications and alignment with his work but stated he could not accept any new students this year. He encouraged Anom to apply to the program and offered the opportunity for a chat via a scheduling link. The response emphasized professionalism and support while clarifying James's current limitations.
